  "hypothesis": "Reuse a private successful serialization audit proof at ordinary ODP commit final validation. Bind exact candidate and source archive identities, prove every emitted XML part either passes equal-or-stricter authored limits or is exact-source copied, and conservatively bound all authored XML bytes/count so final aggregate limits cannot fail. Matching eligible proofs avoid repeated final XML loads/splice/audit work; missing, mismatched or ineligible proofs retain the existing validator. Keep full candidate package reopen, semantic readback and all media/domain/no-op/patch checks unchanged. No public API, dependency, ambient state or validation-policy relaxation.",
